      <p>Not counseling, not therapy, and not a substitute for either. If you're in crisis, talk to your pastor or a licensed counselor first, and I'll gladly walk alongside that. Not a program with a workbook and a certificate. Not a sales funnel. It's Scripture, prayer, and a man who will keep showing up.</p>
